{"_id":"lightsaber-accessory-blade-lock","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"icons/svg/gem.svg","name":"Blade Lock","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":0,"system":{"cost":0,"description":"<p>A mechanical safety lock for the lightsaber blade. Prevents accidental activation. No mechanical game effect.</p>","lightsaber":{"buildDcModifier":0,"category":"accessory","compatibleChassis":["*"],"rarity":"common"},"modifiers":[],"source":"Core Rulebook","upgradeSlots":0},"type":"weaponUpgrade"}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-archaic-lightfoil","name":"Lightfoil, Archaic","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":2250,"chassisId":"archaic-lightfoil","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":4500,"costNumeric":4500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An archaic lightfoil is delicately balanced. Its wielder can choose to treat it as a Small weapon whenever beneficial, but it cannot be wielded two-handed. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":4500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-archaic-lightfoil","recordSha256":"86161fea447f093e"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-archaic-lightsaber","name":"Lightsaber, Archaic","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":15,"baseCost":1000,"chassisId":"archaic-lightsaber","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An archaic lightsaber uses an external power cell worn on the belt or back and connected to the hilt by a cord. It is weaker than a modern lightsaber and requires a special 600-credit power pack to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Archaic"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Archaic"],"upgradeSlots":1,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-archaic-lightsaber","recordSha256":"9006d019ad6d5570"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-crossguard","name":"Crossguard Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":25,"baseCost":2000,"chassisId":"crossguard","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>When using Block with a crossguard lightsaber, each successive Use the Force check in the round takes only a cumulative -2 penalty instead of the normal -5. The wielder takes -2 on Use the Force checks made with Deflect. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":0.7},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Duelist"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Duelist"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-crossguard","recordSha256":"b2f5c3d64165ea56"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-dual-phase","name":"Lightsaber, Dual-Phase","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":25,"baseCost":3000,"chassisId":"dual-phase","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":6000,"costNumeric":6000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>In its default setting a dual-phase lightsaber functions as a normal lightsaber. As a swift action, it can switch to an extended blade that increases reach by 1 square but imposes -2 Reflex Defense against attacks from adjacent targets. A special crystal normally applies to both settings. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":6000,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Dual-Form"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Dual-Form"],"upgradeSlots":3,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-dual-phase","recordSha256":"55603f99f04028a2"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-dueling","name":"Dueling Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":25,"baseCost":1500,"chassisId":"dueling","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>When wielded one-handed, a dueling lightsaber grants a +1 equipment bonus on attack rolls for attacks of opportunity. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":0.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-dueling","recordSha256":"2330c31b2fa3c769"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-great","name":"Lightsaber, Great","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":2500,"chassisId":"great","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":5000,"costNumeric":5000,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A great lightsaber is an oversized lightsaber. Only Large or larger creatures can use it in conjunction with feats that affect light weapons or lightsabers, such as Weapon Finesse. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":5000,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Large-Only"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Large-Only"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-great","recordSha256":"6172ec5455d3bf9c"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-guard-shoto","name":"Guard Shoto","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":3500,"chassisId":"guard-shoto","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":7000,"costNumeric":7000,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A guard shoto, or lightsaber tonfa, has a secondary handle at a right angle. A proficient wielder gains a +2 equipment bonus on Use the Force checks made with Block or Deflect. If its handle is phrik-laced, lightsabers do not ignore the guard shoto's damage reduction. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":7000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Guard"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Guard"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-guard-shoto","recordSha256":"fbf3cadbf03fc7ce"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-lightwhip","name":"Lightwhip","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":25,"baseCost":2500,"chassisId":"lightwhip","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":5000,"costNumeric":5000,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A lightwhip has reach 2 squares. On a hit it deals normal damage and can initiate a grab or grapple. A grabbed or grappled target can escape with a DC 15 Acrobatics check. Pin and Trip can be used with it, but not Crush or Throw. A character ending its turn held by the lightwhip takes the weapon's base damage without Strength, heroic-level, or other modifiers. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":5000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Reach","Whip"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Reach","Whip"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-lightwhip","recordSha256":"2ecaa40959716789"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-longhandle","name":"Long-Handle Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":2250,"chassisId":"longhandle","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":4500,"costNumeric":4500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>When wielded two-handed, a long-handle lightsaber can forgo doubling the wielder's Strength bonus to damage and instead increase its base damage to 2d10. With Long Haft Form it can be used as a double weapon; the haft end deals 1d6 damage. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":4500,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","TwoHanded"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","TwoHanded"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-longhandle","recordSha256":"c1baf26edfb40e82"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-modern-lightfoil","name":"Lightfoil, Modern","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":15,"baseCost":1250,"chassisId":"modern-lightfoil","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A modern lightfoil is delicately balanced. Its wielder can choose to treat it as a Small weapon whenever beneficial, but it cannot be wielded two-handed. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable","Finesse"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-modern-lightfoil","recordSha256":"f87f63fe2c5f4496"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-pike","name":"Lightsaber Pike","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":2000,"chassisId":"pike","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A lightsaber pike has a phrik-alloy haft, so lightsabers do not ignore the weapon's damage reduction. It increases reach by 1 square but imposes a -2 penalty on Use the Force checks made with Block or Deflect. With Long Haft Form it can be used as a double weapon; the non-lightsaber end deals 1d6 damage. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Reach"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Reach"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-pike","recordSha256":"75fbbc4de619ece2"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-retrosaber","name":"Retrosaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":25,"baseCost":2000,"chassisId":"retrosaber","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A retrosaber is a modern reconstruction of an archaic, corded lightsaber. Its base damage is 2d8. As a swift action, the wielder can increase its base damage to 2d10 until the end of the wielder's next turn. It then burns down to 2d4 base damage for one round, during which it cannot be dialed back up.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":0.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Archaic","Variable-Damage"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Archaic","Variable-Damage"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-retrosaber","recordSha256":"b38617a4200064ef"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-chassis-short","name":"Lightsaber, Short","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":1250,"chassisId":"short","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Small Jedi such as Master Yoda favor the short lightsaber, sometimes called a shoto. Jedi skilled at two-weapon fighting often use the shoto as their off-hand weapon. A short lightsaber requires a special energy cell costing ten times the price of an ordinary energy cell, but it lasts almost indefinitely.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Throwable"],"range":"melee","rangeProfile":"melee","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Throwable"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"lightsaber-chassis-short","recordSha256":"f6da4f118b07b141"}}}}
{"_id":"lightsaber-crystal-barab-ingot","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"icons/svg/gem.svg","name":"Barab Ingot","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":0,"system":{"cost":0,"description":"<p>A rare red crystal from Barab I. Grants a +1 force bonus to attack rolls and changes damage type to fire.</p><p><strong>TODO:</strong> Damage type override implementation pending in construction engine.</p>","lightsaber":{"buildDcModifier":0,"category":"crystal","compatibleChassis":["*"],"rarity":"rare"},"modifiers":[{"bonusType":"force","type":"attack","value":1}],"source":"Core Rulebook","upgradeSlots":1},"type":"weaponUpgrade"}
{"_id":"lightsaber-crystal-ilum","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"icons/svg/gem.svg","name":"Ilum Crystal","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":0,"system":{"cost":0,"description":"<p>A Force-attuned crystal from Ilum. Grants a +1 force bonus to attack rolls with the lightsaber.</p>","lightsaber":{"buildDcModifier":0,"category":"crystal","compatibleChassis":["standard","double","short","crossguard"],"rarity":"common"},"modifiers":[{"bonusType":"force","type":"attack","value":1}],"source":"Core Rulebook","upgradeSlots":1},"type":"weaponUpgrade"}
{"_id":"lightsaber-crystal-synthetic","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"icons/svg/gem.svg","name":"Synthetic Crystal","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":0,"system":{"cost":0,"description":"<p>An artificially-created Force crystal. Grants a +1 force bonus to attack rolls. Works with any lightsaber chassis.</p>","lightsaber":{"buildDcModifier":0,"category":"crystal","compatibleChassis":["*"],"rarity":"common"},"modifiers":[{"bonusType":"force","type":"attack","value":1}],"source":"Core Rulebook","upgradeSlots":1},"type":"weaponUpgrade"}
{"_id":"weapon-adhesive-grenade","name":"Adhesive Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Every target in an adhesive grenade's blast radius must make a grapple check against the attacker's ranged attack roll or be unable to move. The adhesive lasts for 3 rounds. Once a character breaks free, that character does not need another grapple check to move through the affected area.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-adhesive-grenade","recordSha256":"0bcb9467bcd5b985"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-adjudicator-slugthrower","name":"Czerka Adjudicator","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"slug-ammunition"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":325,"costNumeric":325,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The Czerka Adjudicator is a compact slugthrower hold-out pistol. It carries only 4 shots and requires a full-round action to reload.</p>","economics":{"cost":325,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-adjudicator-slugthrower","recordSha256":"0693db1be302ab28"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-adventurer-slugthrower","name":"Czerka Adventurer","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":360,"costNumeric":360,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The Czerka Adventurer is a long-barreled slugthrower optimized for range and power. It can be broken down for concealment and reassembled; disassembling or reassembling it is a move action. Its weapon-table entry treats it as an accurate weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":360,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Accurate"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-adventurer-slugthrower","recordSha256":"8bd64454e30bca3a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-amphistaff","name":"Amphistaff","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":0,"costNumeric":0,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An amphistaff is a serpentine creature genetically engineered by the Yuuzhan Vong to serve as a weapon. It has three weapon forms: quarterstaff, spear, or whip; switching forms is a swift action. In quarterstaff form it has all the qualities of a quarterstaff. In spear form it can be wielded or thrown as a spear; if the target takes damage and the attack roll equals or exceeds its Fortitude Defense, the target moves -1 persistent step on the condition track. In whip form it has reach 2 squares; its tail deals 1d4 piercing damage plus the wielder's Strength modifier and uses the same poison condition-track effect. Instead of dealing whip damage, a proficient wielder can use it to pin or trip as though using the Pin or Trip feat without needing that feat. In any form, the wielder can coax it to spit venom up to 10 squares as a standard action; if the attack hits both Reflex and Fortitude Defense, the target moves -1 persistent step on the condition track. It can spit venom only once every 24 standard hours.</p>","economics":{"cost":0,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Amphistaff","recordSha256":"3856288be28f26d6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-arc-9965-blaster","name":"ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":40,"max":40,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1400,"costNumeric":1400,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The ARC-9965 is an accurate weapon and takes no attack penalty at short range. Each autofire attack consumes 10 shots. Its power pack provides 40 shots before replacement, and the rifle has a retractable stock.</p>","economics":{"cost":1400,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"range":"35 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-arc-9965-blaster","recordSha256":"120004594085db0f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-arggarok","name":"Arggarok","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d12","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":150,"costNumeric":150,"damage":"2d12","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A character with Strength lower than 15 takes a -5 penalty on attack rolls made with an Arg'garok. Gamorreans treat the Arg'garok as an advanced melee weapon rather than an exotic weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":150,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Arggarok","recordSha256":"034fe638988726b3"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ascension-gun","name":"Ascension Gun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>As a swift action, an ascension gun can switch between heavy-blaster mode and ascension mode. In ascension mode it fires a syntherope grappling dart: a vertical tether can lift the wielder 12 squares per round with roughly 720 kg maximum lift, and a secured tether can form a downhill zipline traveled at 12 squares per round. Ascension-mode range is 30 squares. The blaster mode uses a 50-shot power pack. The weapon carries two lengths of syntherope, which must be replaced after two uses.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ascension-gun","recordSha256":"c027d25e74a43e0b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-assault-blaster-rifle","name":"Blaster Rifle, Assault","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1750,"costNumeric":1750,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The assault blaster rifle is an accurate weapon: it takes no penalty when attacking a target at short range. It can fire in single-shot or autofire mode. A power pack provides 50 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":1750,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"range":"35 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-assault-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"079682f28f994613"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-atlatl","name":"Atlatl","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A Gungan weapon, the atlatl adds speed and power as an extension of a throwing arm, allowing the user to hurl energy balls farther than with an unaided toss. If forced into close combat, the wielder can use the atlatl as a club-like melee weapon. Although the atlatl is an exotic weapon, Gungans are treated as proficient if they have the Weapon Proficiency (simple weapons) feat.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":1.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Atlatl","recordSha256":"a179e4b8fc5d05de"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-aurial-blaster","name":"Aurial Blaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"sonic"}},"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"sonic","description":"<p>If an aurial blaster hits and the attack roll also exceeds the target's Fortitude Defense, the target takes a -5 penalty on Perception checks until the end of the attacker's next turn. The weapon uses pistol ranges. A power pack provides 50 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-aurial-blaster","recordSha256":"25b85d2e271ff32d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-axe","name":"Axe","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":35,"costNumeric":35,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A modern axe is an unpowered chopping tool that also serves as a melee weapon. The weapon can be thrown.</p>","economics":{"cost":35,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Thrown"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Thrown"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Axe","recordSha256":"7f66a0f19d36370f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-battering-ram","name":"Squib Battering Ram","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"5d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":3500,"costNumeric":3500,"damage":"5d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A Squib battering ram requires two characters to operate: one stabilizes the ram while the other triggers it. It is too unwieldy to use against living, moving targets, but deals its normal damage to stationary unattended objects such as walls or doors. It requires four power packs to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":3500,"weight":10},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"5 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-battering-ram","recordSha256":"430fdbc0df8bc1d9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bayonet","name":"Bayonet","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>When mounted on a rifle, a bayonet allows the rifle to be used as a melee weapon much like a spear. While wielding a rifle with a mounted bayonet, you threaten squares within your reach even if you used the rifle to make a ranged attack on your last turn, and you can use it to make attacks of opportunity. A bayonet requires two hands to use when mounted on a rifle. It cannot be used on a rifle with a folded stock. Detached from a rifle, it is treated as a knife; mounted, it deals more damage because of the added leverage and bulk.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Bayonet","recordSha256":"d42ab6173955fbe6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-black-powder-pistol","name":"Black-Powder Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"black-powder-ammunition"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A black-powder pistol must be reloaded after every shot, and reloading requires a full-round action, preventing the use of feats or talents that allow multiple shots. Ammunition is sold in sets of 50 shots for 5 credits. A character trained in Mechanics can make a DC 20 Perception check to locate suitable materials; after one hour, a DC 15 Mechanics check produces ammunition for 5 shots, plus 5 additional shots for every 5 points by which the check exceeds the DC. The weapon is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Rare","Inaccurate"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Rare","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-black-powder-pistol","recordSha256":"e58be71dd21b5a95"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-blaster-cannon","name":"Blaster Cannon","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d12","type":"energy"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"3d12","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A portable shoulder-fired blaster cannon is an area-effect weapon. It deals full damage to the target if the attack hits its Reflex Defense and half damage if it misses; Evasion modifies this as normal. Every creature or object adjacent to the target takes half damage if the attack hits and no damage if it misses. A blaster cannon requires a power pack; after 10 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":18},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate","Area Attack"],"range":"50 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate","Area Attack"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":18},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-blaster-cannon","recordSha256":"3561ee5b04dc53cb"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-blaster-carbine","name":"Blaster Carbine","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":900,"costNumeric":900,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A blaster carbine has a short barrel and compact two-handed grip. Some models have a retractable stock; a carbine with a retractable stock costs 850 credits instead of 900. Because of its compact design, a blaster carbine can always be used to make an attack of opportunity even if its stock is not folded. It requires a power pack; after 50 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":900,"weight":2.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":[],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-blaster-carbine","recordSha256":"b63019fbb4bb901c"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A blaster pistol is a common sidearm. It requires a power pack; after 100 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":[],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"f12091df59587e9a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-blaster-rifle","name":"Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The basic blaster rifle is standard military issue. Some models have a retractable stock. A blaster rifle without a retractable stock costs 900 credits instead of 1,000 credits. It requires a power pack; after 50 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":4.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":[],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"edc9304b6dde836a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-blastsword","name":"Blastsword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":600,"costNumeric":600,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A blastsword can be treated as a light weapon for purposes of the Weapon Finesse feat. It requires a power pack to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":600,"weight":2.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Blastsword","recordSha256":"557004a7e2f267f8"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bluebolt-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Bluebolt","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":850,"costNumeric":850,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A bluebolt blaster pistol can make stun attacks out to 8 squares instead of the usual 6 squares, but each stun attack consumes one additional shot. It is an inaccurate weapon and cannot attack targets at long range. Its power pack provides 50 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":850,"weight":1.6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"18 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1.6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-bluebolt-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"dba8b9cdb8189c47"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bow","name":"Bow","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"arrow"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The wielder's Strength modifier applies to damage dealt with a bow. A bow holds one arrow at a time and can be reloaded as a free action. A quiver of 10 arrows costs 20 credits and weighs 0.8 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-bow","recordSha256":"919a24596e8713ad"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bowcaster","name":"Bowcaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The Wookiee bowcaster hurls an explosive energy quarrel at high speed. Although it is an exotic weapon, Wookiees are treated as proficient if they have the Weapon Proficiency (rifles) feat. A quiver of 10 quarrels costs 50 credits and weighs 1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Wookiee","Critical 19-20","Strength Required"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Wookiee","Critical 19-20","Strength Required"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-bowcaster","recordSha256":"341e4a46cc0386a5"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bryar-pistol","name":"Bryar Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":1350,"costNumeric":1350,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>As a swift action, a Bryar pistol can be primed for a built-up shot. If no attack is made with it before the start of the wielder's next turn, the next attack made before the end of the encounter deals +1 weapon die and consumes 5 shots. A primed shot cannot be combined with an ability that consumes more than one shot. The pistol uses a power pack that must be recharged after 100 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1350,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed","Accurate"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-bryar-pistol","recordSha256":"9df2d15169300f27"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-bryar-rifle","name":"Bryar Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1350,"costNumeric":1350,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>As a swift action, a Bryar rifle can be primed for a built-up shot. If no attack is made with it before the start of the wielder's next turn, the next attack made before the end of the encounter deals +1 weapon die and consumes 5 shots. A primed shot cannot be combined with an ability that consumes more than one shot. The rifle's power pack must be recharged after 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1350,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-bryar-rifle","recordSha256":"8b41d2295846fcf3"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-carbonite-rifle","name":"Carbonite Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"carbonite-cartridge"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"stun"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A target moved down the condition track by a carbonite rifle is also immobilized until the end of its next turn. The rifle uses special carbonite cartridges; each cartridge costs 50 credits, weighs 1 kg, and provides 20 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-carbonite-rifle","recordSha256":"f217a08b65b76159"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-cesta","name":"Cesta","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Another Gungan weapon, the cesta is a flexible pole used to hurl small energy balls. It can also be used as a stafflike melee weapon. Although the cesta is considered an exotic weapon, Gungans are treated as proficient if they have the Weapon Proficiency (simple weapons) feat.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":1.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Reach"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Reach"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Cesta","recordSha256":"5e3faa3b94891987"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-club-baton","name":"Club/Baton","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":15,"costNumeric":15,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Powered by the wielder's brute strength, clubs break an opponent's bones, or worse. Batons, a variety of the club, are used by police forces on relatively peaceful worlds in crowd-control situations.</p>","economics":{"cost":15,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Club/Baton","recordSha256":"cb221821c1eac044"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-combat-gloves","name":"Combat Gloves","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"0","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":0,"costNumeric":0,"damage":"0","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A pair of padded gloves provides extra hitting power thanks to their weight and construction. They provide a +1 bonus to damage on a successful unarmed attack. Combat gloves are two sizes smaller than their wearer. Because of how they are worn, combat gloves can't be disarmed or dropped.</p>","economics":{"cost":0,"weight":0},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Combat Gloves","recordSha256":"d007511b754223f6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-commando-special-rifle","name":"Commando Special Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":25,"max":25,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":1250,"costNumeric":1250,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The Commando Special is a sawed-off Republic commando rifle built for portability and stopping power. It can fire in single-shot or autofire mode. Its power pack must be replaced after 25 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1250,"weight":3.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":3.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-commando-special-rifle","recordSha256":"11a52e2f71c74a2a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-concealed-dart-launcher","name":"Concealed Dart Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":6,"max":6,"type":"dart-bundle"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"stun"}},"cost":1900,"costNumeric":1900,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A concealed dart launcher is worn on the wrist and fires darts that can be filled with contact poisons; by default a dart contains a sedative that deals stun damage. Unlike a normal weapon set to stun, it can deal stun damage beyond 6 squares and is treated as a pistol for range. Its compact design grants a +5 equipment bonus on Stealth checks to conceal it. A bundle provides 6 darts before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":1900,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-concealed-dart-launcher","recordSha256":"7dd5b14df3c89698"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-concussion-grenade","name":"Concussion Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"8d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"8d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A concussion grenade detonates on contact and affects a 2-square burst. Make one area attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst; a hit deals full damage and a miss deals half damage. Evasion modifies the result normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-concussion-grenade","recordSha256":"76db671efd582c25"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-concussion-rifle","name":"Concussion Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":25,"max":25,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":1800,"costNumeric":1800,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Attacks with a concussion rifle are made against the target's Fortitude Defense. On a successful attack, the target is knocked prone in addition to taking the weapon's damage. The rifle requires a power pack, which must be replaced after 25 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1800,"weight":2.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Rare"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Rare"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-concussion-rifle","recordSha256":"64afa14de4f2b59b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-contact-stunner","name":"Contact Stunner","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":700,"costNumeric":700,"damage":"1d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A contact stunner grants a +5 equipment bonus on Stealth checks made to conceal the weapon. It requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":700,"weight":1.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Contact Stunner","recordSha256":"31333f2179076939"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-cr-1-blast-cannon","name":"CR-1 Blast Cannon","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The CR-1 uses pistol ranges, but range penalties are applied to damage rolls rather than attack rolls. Against an adjacent target it deals +1d8 damage. Against nonadjacent targets it is a splash weapon with a 1-square splash radius.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-cr-1-blast-cannon","recordSha256":"19096a6e9f5048f2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-crossbow","name":"Crossbow","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"crossbow-bolt"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A crossbow holds one bolt at a time and requires a move action to reload. A case of 10 bolts costs 20 credits and weighs 0.6 kg. The weapon is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Inaccurate"],"range":"18 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-crossbow","recordSha256":"c99faba089b8161f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-cryoban-grenade","name":"CryoBan Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>If a CryoBan grenade's attack roll also beats a target's Fortitude Defense, that target's speed is reduced to 2 squares until the end of its next turn.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Cold","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Cold","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-cryoban-grenade","recordSha256":"7e63a5bf9101144d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-darkstick","name":"Darkstick","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A proficient darkstick wielder can hold multiple darksticks in one hand; two or more increase the weapon's damage dice from 1d6 to 2d8. Later darksticks shroud the wielder so adjacent enemies treat the wielder as having total concealment; darkvision ignores this, and the wielder must also be able to see in darkness. A darkstick can be thrown, and if the attack exceeds Reflex Defense by 5 or more it immediately returns to the wielder's hand.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":1.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Thrown"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Thrown"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Darkstick","recordSha256":"7159e9a907bc70aa"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-darter","name":"Darter","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":150,"costNumeric":150,"damage":"1","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A darter launches darts using compressed air. Its maximum range is Short. A poison-carrying dart delivers its toxin if the attack successfully deals damage; darts can also carry surveillance taggers.</p>","economics":{"cost":150,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-darter","recordSha256":"5c2bb6ecbe058b85"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-datadagger","name":"Datadagger","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"1d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A datadagger is a decorative code cylinder concealing a needlelike blade. Twisting the hilt extends the blade. Its concealed construction grants a +5 bonus on Stealth checks made to hide the object, and physically touching the wielder does not grant the usual circumstance bonus to notice the hidden weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Datadagger","recordSha256":"0ef15b8931b2f64b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-deck-sweeper","name":"Deck Sweeper","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":5000,"costNumeric":5000,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>The Deck Sweeper fires only on the stun setting and attacks a 6-square cone. Make one attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in the area; a hit deals full stun damage and a miss deals half stun damage. The weapon must be primed with a swift action during the same turn before it is fired. Its power pack provides 5 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":5000,"weight":4.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":4.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-deck-sweeper","recordSha256":"1880d67b87958b27"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-defender-microblaster","name":"Gee-Tech 12 Defender Microblaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":2,"max":2,"type":"integrated-power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The Gee-Tech 12 Defender is extremely small and grants a +5 bonus on Stealth checks to conceal it. It carries only enough power for two shots and has a maximum range of 3 squares. Its power pack is integrated and cannot be recharged once spent, making the weapon disposable.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":0.25},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":0.25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-defender-microblaster","recordSha256":"6ea3d1391cc7adb6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-dh-23-blaster-pistol","name":"BlasTech DH-23 Outback Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DH-23 sacrifices range and raw power for exceptional durability. Its heat radiator and tight construction give the weapon Strength 17 and a Break DC of 20.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-dh-23-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"0a8a24cbe7d49d3f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-dire-sword","name":"Dire Sword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"1d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The dire sword is an archaic, unpowered dueling sword: essentially a refined longsword built with modern materials. Its published entry grants no additional special combat rule beyond the weapon-table statistics.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Dire Sword","recordSha256":"53dec4e3543dfdf9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-dire-vibroblade","name":"Dire Vibroblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":60,"costNumeric":60,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The dire vibroblade is a larger vibroblade with an extended hilt intended for two-handed use. A Medium wielder can gain double the wielder's Strength bonus to damage when using it two-handed. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":60,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Dire Vibroblade","recordSha256":"8d10cdc6d0a22a15"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-discblade","name":"Discblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A discblade is an aerodynamic thrown ring weapon. A trained Zeison Sha warrior can use the Force to return it to hand after it has been thrown; return is not an automatic property of every throw.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":1.25},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Rare"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Rare"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1.25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-discblade","recordSha256":"3480eb8c8043d425"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-disruptor-pistol","name":"DX-2 Disruptor Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DX-2 treats every target as though its damage threshold were 5 lower. A creature killed, or an object, droid, or vehicle destroyed, by it is disintegrated. It can fire only once every other round and cannot use feats, talents, or abilities that consume more than one shot in a round. Its power pack must be recharged after 10 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Disruptor","Illegal"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Disruptor","Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-disruptor-pistol","recordSha256":"821efe06c305c31e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-disruptor-rifle","name":"DXR-6 Disruptor Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":3500,"costNumeric":3500,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DXR-6 treats every target as though its damage threshold were 5 lower. A creature killed, or an object, droid, or vehicle destroyed, by it is disintegrated. It can fire only once every other round and cannot use feats, talents, or abilities that consume more than one shot in a round. Its power pack must be recharged after 10 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":3500,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Disruptor","Illegal","Banned"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Disruptor","Illegal","Banned"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-disruptor-rifle","recordSha256":"af075bec3c62c3ad"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-dlt-20a-longblaster","name":"BlasTech DLT-20A \"Longbarrel\" Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":1300,"costNumeric":1300,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DLT-20A includes a top-mounted rangefinder and electronic sight that functions as a standard targeting scope. Its magnatomic adhesion grip improves control, granting a +1 equipment bonus to Reflex Defense when the wielder is the target of a disarm attack.</p>","economics":{"cost":1300,"weight":6.7},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Accurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6.7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-dlt-20a-longblaster","recordSha256":"338e6cc69a0d5189"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-double-barreled-blaster-carbine","name":"Blaster Carbine, Double-Barreled","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A double-barreled blaster carbine cannot make autofire attacks. As a swift action it can switch to double-shot mode; in that mode it is an area-effect weapon targeting a 2-square-by-2-square area. A target hit takes full damage (half with Evasion), while a miss deals half damage (none with Evasion). Each double-shot attack consumes 2 shots, and while using double-shot mode the wielder cannot use any feat, talent, or effect that consumes more than one shot in a round, including Double Attack or Rapid Shot. Like other blaster carbines, it can make attacks of opportunity even without a folded stock. It is inaccurate and cannot attack at long range. A power pack provides 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":1.9},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":1.9},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-double-barreled-blaster-carbine","recordSha256":"25c33beb6a1cffe6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber","name":"Lightsaber, Double","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":3500,"category":"weapon","chassisId":"double","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":7000,"costNumeric":7000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A double-bladed lightsaber consists of two sabers fused at their hilts. One or both blades can be ignited at once. With both blades ignited, it is a double weapon. You can attack with both ends as a full-round action, but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty; certain feats and talents can reduce these penalties. It requires two special energy cells, each costing ten times an ordinary energy cell and lasting almost indefinitely.</p>","economics":{"cost":7000,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"lightsaber","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber","recordSha256":"9ed07da8b89ded9e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-double-bladed-sword","name":"Double-Bladed Sword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":120,"costNumeric":120,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A double-bladed sword is a double weapon. A wielder can attack with both ends as a full-round action; both attack rolls take a -10 penalty before reductions from applicable feats or talents.</p>","economics":{"cost":120,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Double-Bladed Sword","recordSha256":"f8a089e3418d17b2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-double-vibroblade","name":"Double Vibroblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":550,"costNumeric":550,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A double vibroblade is a double weapon. A wielder can attack with both ends as a full-round action; both attack rolls take a -10 penalty before reductions from applicable feats or talents. It requires two energy cells.</p>","economics":{"cost":550,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Double Vibroblade","recordSha256":"447b59c1ebef2129"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-dt-12-heavy-blaster","name":"BlasTech DT-12 Heavy Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":900,"costNumeric":900,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DT-12 uses an enlarged trigger grip intended for species with non-Human hand shapes and trades weight and long-range accuracy for greater power. It is an inaccurate weapon as indicated by its weapon-table entry.</p>","economics":{"cost":900,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"18 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-dt-12-heavy-blaster","recordSha256":"514901da24ca968f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-e-web-missile-launcher","name":"E-Web Missile Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"missiles"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"6d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":9500,"costNumeric":9500,"damage":"6d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An E-Web missile launcher is tripod mounted and is treated as one size smaller when mounted. It fires only in single-fire mode, requires no power generator, and attacks a 2-by-2-square area. It normally needs a second crew member to reload it as a move action and can fire only one shot per round. The wielder can spend two swift actions before an attack to treat the target's range as one step shorter. Missiles cost 75 credits each.</p>","economics":{"cost":9500,"weight":42},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"60 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":42},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-e-web-missile-launcher","recordSha256":"ceac5010fae0f15f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-e-web-repeating-blaster","name":"E-Web Repeating Blaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d12","type":"energy"}},"cost":8000,"costNumeric":8000,"damage":"3d12","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An E-Web repeating blaster can normally be fired only when mounted on a tripod. When mounted on a tripod, it is treated as one size smaller for purposes of being wielded. It operates only in autofire mode and requires a power generator. It also requires a second crewman to regulate the generator: the crewman must spend a swift action while adjacent to the weapon. If its power was not regulated since the same initiative count in the previous round, attacks with the E-Web take a -2 penalty.</p>","economics":{"cost":8000,"weight":38},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"50 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":38},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-e-web-repeating-blaster","recordSha256":"0ebabb5b4c1cd85a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-electronet","name":"Electronet","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"electronet"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"stun"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>An electronet is specialized ammunition fired from a grenade launcher. It targets a 2-by-2-square area; make one attack roll against the Reflex Defense of each target in the area. A hit deals the electronet's stun damage and grabs the target as with a normal net. At the beginning of the attacker's turn, any target still trapped by the electronet takes its listed stun damage again without normal damage modifiers.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-electronet","recordSha256":"347472256273f82c"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-electrostaff","name":"Electrostaff","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An electrostaff is a double weapon. Each end has an electromagnetic pulse generator; either end can be set to stun its target instead. The staff is made of resilient phrik alloy that gives it DR 20, and this damage reduction applies even against lightsaber attacks. An electrostaff requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Electric","Lightsaber Resistant","Two-Handed"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Electric","Lightsaber Resistant","Two-Handed"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-electrostaff","recordSha256":"8d8f84f60e3276c9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-emp-grenade","name":"EMP Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An EMP grenade makes one area attack against the Reflex Defense of every target in its 2-square burst. Droids, vehicles, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures take normal ion damage on a hit or half on a miss. If the pre-halving ion damage would reduce such a target to 0 hit points, the target moves -5 steps on the condition track and is disabled. Creatures without cybernetics take half ion damage on a hit and none on a miss, with no other ion effect. Evasion modifies the area attack normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted","Ion"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-emp-grenade","recordSha256":"b7222ae240cb8c95"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-energy-ball","name":"Energy Ball","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"energy-ball"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":20,"costNumeric":20,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Energy balls are the ammunition hurled by Gungan atlatls and cestas. For range, an energy ball thrown by hand is treated as a thrown weapon, hurled by an atlatl as a simple weapon, and hurled by a cesta as an accurate simple weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":20,"weight":0.25},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Licensed","Rare"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Licensed","Rare"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-energy-ball","recordSha256":"84beea7817f9cc15"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-energy-lance","name":"Energy Lance","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":3500,"costNumeric":3500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An energy lance is a force-pike-like mounted weapon incorporating an electromagnetic pulse generator. Although Large, a Medium creature trained in Ride can wield it one-handed while mounted; a Medium creature using it while not mounted takes a -1 attack penalty. The lance can also fire a plasma bolt, functioning as a blaster carbine without a stun setting and using a power pack with the same capacity as a blaster carbine. The lance itself requires two energy cells, and both its melee and ranged attacks work underwater.</p>","economics":{"cost":3500,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Energy Lance","recordSha256":"f3d882ce275a25f0"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-entrenching-tool","name":"Entrenching Tool","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An entrenching tool can be configured as a shovel, pickaxe, or makeshift hammer. When used as a weapon it takes only a -2 penalty on attack rolls instead of the normal -5 improvised-weapon penalty, and the wielder can choose piercing or slashing damage.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Entrenching Tool","recordSha256":"15ebb0e638275887"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-espo-500-riot-gun","name":"BlasTech 500 Riot Gun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The BlasTech 500 riot gun functions much like a blaster carbine but favors autofire. In single-shot mode it imposes a -1 penalty on ranged attack rolls; in autofire mode it grants a +2 equipment bonus on the attack roll. It uses a power pack with 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":2.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"28 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-espo-500-riot-gun","recordSha256":"93703181dc0ce67d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-felucian-skullblade","name":"Felucian Skullblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A Felucian skullblade is a bone weapon containing traces of Force-reactive crystal. When imbued with Force energy it can block lightsaber strikes. The weapon is culturally important and is normally obtained through Felucian Force adepts rather than ordinary commerce.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Felucian Skullblade","recordSha256":"1cd0db939ea1ebd5"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-fira","name":"Fira","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A fira is forged from a cortosis-bearing alloy and benefits from the Cortosis Weave/Phrik Alloy gear template. If an attack roll with the fira against a living creature equals or exceeds both the target's Reflex Defense and Fortitude Defense, the target takes half the attack's damage again on the following round from the grievous wound.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Fira","recordSha256":"314e01093bb72d16"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-fire-blade","name":"Fire Blade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A fire blade ignores the damage reduction of unattended objects and requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Fire Blade","recordSha256":"4c986f24bd9cb15c"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-firelance-blaster-rifle","name":"SoroSuub Firelance Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The SoroSuub Firelance is a light blaster rifle notable for its unusually effective stun setting. Its weapon-table entry provides a stronger stun-damage profile than its normal lethal shot.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":2.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Autofire"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-firelance-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"0b4c0da9a3d8eedd"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-flame-cannon","name":"Flame Cannon","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"flame-cannon-tank"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"5d6","type":"fire"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"5d6","damageType":"fire","description":"<p>A flame cannon projects a cone 12 squares long and 8 squares wide at the end. Make one attack roll against every target's Reflex Defense; a hit deals full fire damage and a miss half, with Evasion applying normally. Reloading is a full-round action. A tank provides 20 uses; replacement tanks cost 600 credits and weigh 20 kg. On a tripod it is treated as one size smaller for wielding.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-flame-cannon","recordSha256":"9b18d588757eb149"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-flamethrower","name":"Flamethrower","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"chemical-cartridge"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"fire"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"fire","description":"<p>A flamethrower shoots a cone of burning chemicals 6 squares long and 6 squares wide at the terminus. Make one attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in the area; Evasion modifies the area attack as normal. Reloading is a full-round action. The weapon can be used five times before its chemical supply is depleted. Replacement chemical cartridges cost 200 credits and weigh 4 kg each.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":7},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Exotic","Area Effect","Fire","Cone"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Exotic","Area Effect","Fire","Cone"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-flamethrower","recordSha256":"b51b09dbf0e95743"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-flash-canister","name":"R-9 Flash Canister","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"Special","type":"energy"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"Special","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An R-9 flash canister has a 3-square burst and detonates on contact. Make one area attack roll against each target's Reflex Defense. Creatures hit take no damage, but all targets have total concealment against each affected creature until the start of the attacker's next turn. Blind creatures are immune.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-flash-canister","recordSha256":"aaa4289f2ef6e17f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-flechette-launcher","name":"Flechette Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"flechette-canister"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1100,"costNumeric":1100,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A flechette launcher is a splash weapon with a 1-square splash radius. Because it is single-shot, it cannot be used with Rapid Shot or another feat or talent that expends more than one shot. It uses special four-shot ammunition canisters costing 50 credits.</p>","economics":{"cost":1100,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-flechette-launcher","recordSha256":"ac9c06b5c1f8c69f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-force-pike","name":"Force Pike","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A force pike is a 1-meter pole topped with a power tip. A two-setting power dial lets the user set the weapon to lethal or stun. Although primarily a vibro weapon, the force pike also delivers an electrical shock through its tip, dealing both piercing and energy damage. It requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Force Pike","recordSha256":"b3812c08650cafa0"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-frag-grenade","name":"Grenade, Frag","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A fragmentation grenade explodes on contact after being thrown and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make a single attack roll and compare it with the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Targets hit take full damage and targets missed take half damage; Evasion modifies this as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-frag-grenade","recordSha256":"30315b15dd3d74b2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-garrote","name":"Garrote","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A garrote requires two hands to use, and an attack with it is treated as a grab attack. Bonuses from talents and feats that apply to the garrote apply to that grab attack. At the beginning of a grabbed target's turn, before it acts, the target takes the garrote's damage and moves -1 step on the condition track, in addition to the normal effects of a grab. The target can attempt to break the grab normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Garrote","recordSha256":"9d83bd815b325ce1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-gas-grenade","name":"Gas Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A gas grenade detonates on contact and attacks every target in a 4-square blast against Fortitude Defense. A hit moves the target -2 steps on the condition track, or -1 step if the target has Evasion; a miss has no effect. Creatures protected from atmospheric hazards are immune. The gas also provides concealment within the blast area and between creatures inside and outside it until the end of the attacker's next turn.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-gas-grenade","recordSha256":"e533149921c08523"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-grenade-launcher","name":"Grenade Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"grenade"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"Special","type":"stun"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"Special","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A grenade launcher extends grenade range. Grenades fired by it always explode on impact regardless of timers; the grenade used determines damage, damage type, and burst radius. It cannot fire thermal detonators. It holds four grenades and reloads as a full-round action. It can be mounted on a rifle in 1 minute with a DC 15 Mechanics check or used as a separate weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-grenade-launcher","recordSha256":"48e26ff6fc60da07"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-gungan-electropole","name":"Electropole","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>An electropole can be thrown like a javelin. Gungans with Weapon Proficiency (simple weapons) are considered proficient with the electropole. It requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":1.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Electric","Stun Option","Two-Handed"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Electric","Stun Option","Two-Handed"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-gungan-electropole","recordSha256":"0d2ad73f9620a384"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-assault-blaster","name":"Blaster Rifle, Heavy Assault","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>When a heavy assault blaster rifle scores a critical hit, its damage dice change from d10s to d12s. It is an inaccurate weapon and cannot attack targets at long range. A power pack provides 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":7},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"range":"35 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-assault-blaster","recordSha256":"d0a5da985cfcbfc0"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-blaster-cannon","name":"Heavy Blaster Cannon","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d12","type":"energy"}},"cost":4200,"costNumeric":4200,"damage":"4d12","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A heavy blaster cannon can be braced by spending two swift actions in the same round immediately before making an attack. While braced it is treated as a Large weapon and can be fired by a Medium character; if not braced, it cannot be fired by a Medium or smaller creature. It is an area-effect weapon: the primary target takes full damage on a hit (half with Evasion) or half damage on a miss (none with Evasion); each creature or object adjacent to the target takes half damage if the attack hits (none with Evasion) and no damage if it misses. It is inaccurate and cannot attack at long range. A power pack provides 10 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":4200,"weight":22},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate","Area Attack"],"range":"60 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate","Area Attack"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":22},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-blaster-cannon","recordSha256":"1fcc1881e936d577"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Heavy","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":750,"costNumeric":750,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A heavy blaster pistol provides rifle-like firepower in a compact sidearm by drawing more heavily on its power pack. It requires a power pack; after 50 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":750,"weight":1.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":[],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"952fb90f1eb25326"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-blaster-rifle","name":"Blaster Rifle, Heavy","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":30,"max":30,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The heavy blaster rifle is a larger, more powerful version of the blaster rifle and is not well suited to close-quarters fighting. It requires a power pack; after 30 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":[],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"7e1c31db82829e4b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-repeating-blaster","name":"Heavy Repeating Blaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A heavy repeating blaster operates only in autofire mode. If used without a tripod or other mount, it cannot be braced before making an autofire attack. It requires a power pack; after 20 shots the pack must be replaced. It can instead be attached to a power generator for longer use.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":12},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":12},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-repeating-blaster","recordSha256":"0622c61087a6f9dc"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-slugthrower-pistol","name":"Heavy Slugthrower Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":8,"max":8,"type":"ammo-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>When using Double Attack, Triple Attack, or Rapid Shot with a heavy slugthrower pistol, the wielder takes an additional -1 penalty on the attack rolls. The pistol uses an 8-shot ammunition clip; a replacement clip costs 15 credits and weighs 0.1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":2.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":2.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-slugthrower-pistol","recordSha256":"b96c48acd43e0635"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-sonic-pistol","name":"Heavy Sonic Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"sonic"}},"cost":1250,"costNumeric":1250,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"sonic","description":"<p>A heavy sonic pistol fires more intensely compressed sonic energy than a standard sonic pistol. Its ranged attacks cannot be negated with Deflect or talents that have Deflect as a prerequisite. Its power pack must be recharged after 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1250,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-sonic-pistol","recordSha256":"dd1e213c8c907573"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-heavy-variable-blaster","name":"Blaster Rifle, Heavy Variable","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":2250,"costNumeric":2250,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A heavy variable blaster rifle has the same 500-shot variable-power system, with stronger settings consuming ten or twenty times normal ammunition. It also has an ascension mode using a syntherope grappling dart, with the same 12-squares-per-round lifting/zipline use and 30-square ascension range as an ascension gun.</p>","economics":{"cost":2250,"weight":6.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"35 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-heavy-variable-blaster","recordSha256":"d7f3cd9c96233b11"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-hold-out-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Hold-Out","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":6,"max":6,"type":"energy-cell"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Because of its compact design, a hold-out blaster pistol grants a +5 equipment bonus on Stealth checks made to conceal the weapon. It requires an energy cell; after 6 shots the energy cell must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-hold-out-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"fb4fce3d9dcc2469"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-hunting-blaster-carbine","name":"Blaster Carbine, Hunting","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A hunting blaster carbine cannot make autofire attacks. On a critical hit, its damage dice change from d8s to d10s. It has a retractable stock and, like other blaster carbines, can make attacks of opportunity even when the stock is not folded. It is inaccurate and cannot attack at long range. A power pack provides 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":2.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"range":"28 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-hunting-blaster-carbine","recordSha256":"f3a490753b867ae4"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-incinerator-rifle","name":"Incinerator Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":3500,"costNumeric":3500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A creature or character killed by an incinerator rifle, or a droid, object, or vehicle destroyed by one, is automatically disintegrated and leaves no trace. The rifle requires a power pack and must have it replaced after 20 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":3500,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-incinerator-rifle","recordSha256":"946493be52ba9d0a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-interchangeable-weapon-system","name":"Interchangeable Weapon System","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":4500,"costNumeric":4500,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The DC-17m Interchangeable Weapon System switches among blaster-rifle, sniper-rifle, and anti-armor grenade-launcher modes as a standard action. Blaster mode functions as a normal blaster rifle. Sniper mode includes a targeting scope, removes the short-range penalty, and imposes -2 against targets at unmodified point-blank range. Anti-armor mode is a single-shot heavy-weapon grenade launcher firing special 3-square-burst ammunition.</p>","economics":{"cost":4500,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-interchangeable-weapon-system","recordSha256":"365a8fac49d13e6f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ion-carbine","name":"Ion Carbine","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":30,"max":30,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The ion carbine functions as an ion weapon and can fire in either single-shot or autofire mode. It is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range. A power pack provides 30 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate","Autofire","Ion"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate","Autofire","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ion-carbine","recordSha256":"eb4bd6ba91e2c207"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ion-grenade","name":"Grenade, Ion","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An ion grenade explodes on contact and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make one attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Droids, vehicles, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures hit take full ion damage and those missed take half; ion damage can move them down the condition track. Creatures without cybernetics take half ion damage on a hit and none on a miss and suffer no other ill effects. Evasion modifies the area attack as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted","Ion"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ion-grenade","recordSha256":"9cda5657341e0ddd"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ion-pistol","name":"Ion Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":30,"max":30,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An ion pistol is effective against droids, vehicles, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures. It deals full ion damage to such targets and can move them down the condition track. Creatures without cybernetics take half damage from a successful attack and suffer no other ill effects. It requires a power pack; after 30 shots the pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed","Ion"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ion-pistol","recordSha256":"741784ad3ad7c56f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ion-rifle","name":"Ion Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An ion rifle is a larger version of the ion pistol and uses the same ion-damage rules. It requires a power pack; after 20 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":3.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Ion"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":3.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ion-rifle","recordSha256":"e5797c92e08ecf8b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-knife","name":"Knife","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":25,"costNumeric":25,"damage":"1d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>While many weapons rely on highly advanced technology, knives still see wide use. A knife is completely silent and serves well in close-combat skirmishes.</p>","economics":{"cost":25,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Thrown"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Thrown"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Knife","recordSha256":"50607e386e7e5dba"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-light-concussion-missile-launcher","name":"Light Concussion Missile Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"4d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>This antivehicle launcher fires one light concussion missile per attack. Rapid Shot cannot be used with it. Each missile has a 2-square splash radius, and attacks against targets smaller than Huge take a -10 penalty.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":18},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"60 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":18},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-light-concussion-missile-launcher","recordSha256":"d5c3b14af7c42f65"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-light-repeating-blaster","name":"Blaster Rifle, Light Repeating","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":30,"max":30,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The light repeating blaster is an autofire-only rifle. It requires a power pack; after 30 shots the pack must be replaced. It can also be attached to a power generator for longer use.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-light-repeating-blaster","recordSha256":"cb7ad418ce9b562b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-lightfoil","name":"Lightfoil","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":4500,"costNumeric":4500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A lightfoil is delicately balanced. Its wielder may choose to treat it as a Small weapon whenever doing so is beneficial. It cannot be wielded two-handed. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":4500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Finesse","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Finesse","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-lightfoil","recordSha256":"11f99144aa51dc68"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-lightsaber","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"baseBuildDc":20,"baseCost":1500,"category":"weapon","chassisId":"standard","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"constructible":true,"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The lightsaber features a handgrip hilt that projects a blade of pure energy. Its blade is generated by an energy cell and focused through crystals within the hilt. It can cut through most materials, except another lightsaber blade, an energy shield, or a few exotic materials, given enough time. Because only the handgrip has weight, unskilled users have difficulty judging the blade's position. A lightsaber requires a special energy cell costing ten times the price of an ordinary energy cell, but it lasts almost indefinitely.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"installedUpgrades":[],"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"lightsaber","subtype":"lightsaber","traits":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"upgradeSlots":2,"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"attunedBy":null,"builtAt":null,"builtBy":null,"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-lightsaber","recordSha256":"6162026ac0bfcd98"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-mace","name":"Mace","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The mace is a weapon made of metal, consisting of a heavy ball atop a handle.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":2.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":2.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Mace","recordSha256":"d96c7b3cf211e693"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-magna-caster","name":"Magna Caster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"bolt-case"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A magna caster grants a +5 equipment bonus on Stealth checks made to snipe. It uses a case of 10 bolts; a replacement case costs 50 credits and weighs 1 kg. The weapon is accurate and takes no attack penalty at short range.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Restricted","Accurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Restricted","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-magna-caster","recordSha256":"ef33d65468847fce"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-massassi-lanvarok","name":"Massassi Lanvarok","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"disc"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A Massassi lanvarok can hurl a disc using thrown-weapon ranges. After the disc is hurled, the lanvarok can be used as a two-handed slashing weapon dealing its listed melee damage. Massassi treat it as an advanced melee weapon instead of an exotic weapon. It is inaccurate for its ranged use and holds one disc at a time; replacement discs cost 5 credits and weigh 0.1 kg each.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":9.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Rare","Inaccurate"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Rare","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":9.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-massassi-lanvarok","recordSha256":"d1cd8bbcd4546c39"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-micro-grenade-launcher","name":"Micro Grenade Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"micro-grenade"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"Special","type":"stun"}},"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"Special","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A micro grenade launcher fires miniature grenades and is treated as a rifle. Micro grenades use the normal rules for their grenade type but deal two fewer dice of damage on a successful hit. The launcher holds four micro grenades and requires a full-round action to reload. It can be mounted on a rifle in 1 minute with a DC 15 Mechanics check or used as a separate weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-micro-grenade-launcher","recordSha256":"4262d7f218dc9e70"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-miniature-proton-torpedo-launcher","name":"Miniature Proton Torpedo Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"miniature-proton-torpedo"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"6d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"6d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>This four-shot launcher normally makes area attacks in a 2-square blast. After firing, the wielder must spend a standard action to reset the launcher. As a swift action it can be switched to single-target mode; in that mode it no longer makes an area attack, deals 6d10x2 damage, and takes a -10 attack penalty against targets smaller than Huge.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-miniature-proton-torpedo-launcher","recordSha256":"41d741dcf8f5c223"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-missile-launcher","name":"Missile Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":4,"max":4,"type":"missile-magazine"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"6d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"6d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A missile launcher fires explosive projectiles affecting a 2-square burst radius. Make one attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst; a hit deals full damage and a miss deals half, with Evasion modifying this as normal. The launcher holds four missiles and reloads as a full-round action. Replacement magazines hold four missiles, cost 200 credits, and weigh 5 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":10},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"40 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-missile-launcher","recordSha256":"7c0ccb2bbd844e4e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-model-434-deathhammer","name":"Merr-Sonn Model 434 DeathHammer","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":650,"costNumeric":650,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The Model 434 DeathHammer is built with heavy durasteel plating. That construction gives the weapon a +2 equipment bonus to its damage reduction.</p>","economics":{"cost":650,"weight":1.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-model-434-deathhammer","recordSha256":"800136b778871dc1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-mortar-launcher","name":"Mortar Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"mortar-shell-magazine"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A mortar launcher cannot attack targets at point-blank range. For line of sight and cover, its point of origin can be treated as 20 squares in the air. Its magazine holds five shells and automatically feeds each shot; shells are statistically identical to grenades.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":20},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"100 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":20},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-mortar-launcher","recordSha256":"490e308d64206f93"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-mythosaur-axe","name":"Mythosaur Axe","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d12","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"1d12","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The standard Mythosaur axe is a ceremonial simple weapon made from calcified Mythosaur bone. The text also describes Mandalore the Ultimate's special staff-mounted version, which uses modern metals and an energy cell to deal double the standard weapon's damage; that named-character variant is not a second generic equipment identity.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":10},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Mythosaur Axe","recordSha256":"b016c2b866631b54"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-needler","name":"Needler","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"ammunition-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":650,"costNumeric":650,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A needler fires tiny piercing darts. Its ammunition can be laced with a contact poison, delivering that poison when appropriate. The weapon is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range. A 10-shot ammunition clip costs 20 credits and weighs 0.1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":650,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-needler","recordSha256":"4d997f85d901f455"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-net","name":"Net","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":25,"costNumeric":25,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A net lets you initiate a grab or grapple against a character at range. A grabbed or grappled character can escape with a DC 15 Acrobatics check or break out with a DC 20 Strength check. You can use the Pin and Trip feats with a net, but not Crush or Throw.</p>","economics":{"cost":25,"weight":4.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Inaccurate"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":4.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-net","recordSha256":"7873fa5622bb1709"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-neural-inhibitor","name":"Neural Inhibitor","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":4200,"costNumeric":4200,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A neural inhibitor fires a high-velocity dart that injects neurotoxin into a living target. On a hit, the dart makes a 1d20+5 attack against the target's Fortitude Defense. On success the target moves -1 step down the condition track. If that poison attack fails, the next poison attack gains a cumulative +1 bonus until one succeeds. The poison is persistent and attacks again at the beginning of the target's turns until cured with a DC 20 Treat Injury check. If the target falls unconscious, the neurotoxin dissipates.</p>","economics":{"cost":4200,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-neural-inhibitor","recordSha256":"ee98f81b4a37338b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-neuronic-whip","name":"Neuronic Whip","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"stun"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A target hit by a neuronic whip takes its normal stun damage plus 1d4 slashing damage. The whip increases the wielder's reach by 1 square and requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Reach"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Reach"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Neuronic Whip","recordSha256":"b1ffab5aab61d914"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-plx-2m-portable-missile-launcher","name":"Merr-Sonn PLX-2M Portable Missile Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":6,"max":6,"type":"arakyd-3t3-missile"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"8d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":2250,"costNumeric":2250,"damage":"8d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The PLX-2M can fire directly or use specialized heat-seeking/gravity-activated targeting modes that penalize the Reflex Defense of the chosen target type. Its missiles detonate in a 3-square burst and use the normal area-attack procedure. The launcher holds six missiles and reloads as a full-round action. A six-missile replacement pack costs 350 credits and weighs 8 kg. A built-in microrepulsorlift means the launcher does not count against encumbrance while carried as the character's active drawn weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":2250,"weight":48},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Inaccurate"],"range":"50 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":48},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-plx-2m-portable-missile-launcher","recordSha256":"f743cd304291e1b1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-power-hammer","name":"Power Hammer","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d12","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"2d12","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Extra damage from Power Attack can be added to damage dealt to an object or vehicle with a power hammer. Using Double Attack, Triple Attack, or Rapid Strike with it imposes an additional -2 penalty on attack rolls. A power hammer requires two energy cells.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":10},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Power Hammer","recordSha256":"327b5ea349bf80f1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-power-lance","name":"Power Lance","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A power lance is an energy lance that lacks the plasma-bolt firing capability. It retains the energy lance's mounted-melee design but is cheaper and mass-produced for cavalry and speeder-bike scouts.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Power Lance","recordSha256":"33b963b3feaca417"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-pulse-rifle","name":"Pulse Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":5000,"costNumeric":5000,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A pulse rifle fires a 6-square cone as an area attack. Make one attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in the area; a hit deals normal damage and a miss deals half damage. Its power pack provides 5 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":5000,"weight":2.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":2.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-pulse-rifle","recordSha256":"acb1239e11ae602a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-pulse-wave-pistol","name":"Pulse-Wave Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A pulse-wave pistol gains a +4 equipment bonus to damage at point-blank range. It is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range. A power pack provides 100 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-pulse-wave-pistol","recordSha256":"b2511f4054b6f6cb"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-pulse-wave-rifle","name":"Pulse-Wave Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":550,"costNumeric":550,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A pulse-wave rifle gains a +5 equipment bonus to damage at point-blank range. It is inaccurate and cannot attack targets at long range. A power pack provides 50 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":550,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-pulse-wave-rifle","recordSha256":"9b3a1a3c7db997c4"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-quarterstaff","name":"Quarterstaff","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":65,"costNumeric":65,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A quarterstaff is made of wood, plasteel, or a metal alloy. A user can strike with either end. A quarterstaff is a double weapon. You can attack with both ends as a full-round action, but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty; certain feats and talents can reduce these penalties.</p>","economics":{"cost":65,"weight":1.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Quarterstaff","recordSha256":"d2321c2c13eeeba1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-radiation-grenade","name":"Grenade, Radiation","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A radiation grenade affects a 2-square burst and resolves its area attack against Fortitude Defense rather than Reflex Defense. Hits take full damage and misses half, with Evasion applying as printed. Targets are also exposed to Moderate radiation for damage and Treat Injury purposes.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-radiation-grenade","recordSha256":"6b4a9520688d5271"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-rail-detonator-gun","name":"Rail Detonator Gun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"explosive-canister-magazine"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1900,"costNumeric":1900,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A rail detonator gun is a splash weapon with a 1-square splash radius. It uses magazines of special explosive canisters; each magazine holds 10 shots and costs 50 credits.</p>","economics":{"cost":1900,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-rail-detonator-gun","recordSha256":"02066bb5a6e5ad4b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-razor-bug","name":"Razor Bug","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A razor bug is thrown by hand but is treated as a simple weapon, not a thrown weapon, for purposes of determining range. It is an accurate weapon and takes no attack penalty at short range.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-razor-bug","recordSha256":"c16a90da23894b94"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-remote-grenade","name":"Remote Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A remote grenade is programmed for remote detonation using the manufacturer's handheld detonator, which costs 100 credits. Its safety system prevents remote detonation of deployed grenades within 100 meters of the transmitter.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-remote-grenade","recordSha256":"03d668f26a73d2c9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-repeating-blaster-carbine","name":"Blaster Carbine, Repeating","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":30,"max":30,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The repeating blaster carbine is an autofire-only, inaccurate area-attack weapon. It cannot attack targets at long range. A power pack provides 30 shots before replacement.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Inaccurate","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-repeating-blaster-carbine","recordSha256":"d67af951883fd22d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-repeating-crossbow","name":"Crossbow, Repeating","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"quarrel-magazine"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A repeating crossbow automatically recocks and feeds the next quarrel after each shot. Its magazine holds 10 quarrels, costs 30 credits, weighs 1.2 kg, and can be replaced as a move action.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":1.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"18 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-repeating-crossbow","recordSha256":"bb8030783e16d9a7"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ripper","name":"Ripper","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"ammunition-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":750,"costNumeric":750,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A ripper fires physical shrapnel. If its damage exceeds a target's damage threshold and moves that target at least 1 step down the condition track, embedded shrapnel immediately deals an additional 1d4 damage. The weapon is inaccurate and cannot attack at long range. A 10-shot ammunition clip costs 20 credits and weighs 0.1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":750,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ripper","recordSha256":"832724e6d3d65cae"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-rotary-blaster-cannon","name":"Rotary Blaster Cannon","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":5500,"costNumeric":5500,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>If braced before firing, a rotary blaster cannon can autofire into a 2-by-4-square area instead of the normal 2-by-2. If not braced, it takes an additional -5 attack penalty beyond normal autofire penalties. It uses a 20-shot power pack or can be connected to a power generator.</p>","economics":{"cost":5500,"weight":16},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"45 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":16},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-rotary-blaster-cannon","recordSha256":"9d48e4624bbd6034"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-san-ni-staff","name":"San-Ni Staff","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":4500,"costNumeric":4500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A san-ni staff is a double weapon. It can be used with Block as though it were a lightsaber. When an attack is made, the wielder can choose to strike with its energy couplings and deal stun damage instead of lethal damage. It requires two energy cells.</p>","economics":{"cost":4500,"weight":2.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::San-Ni Staff","recordSha256":"c1a936de69db6f90"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-scattergun","name":"Scatter Gun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"individual-shells"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8 or 2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":275,"costNumeric":275,"damage":"3d8 or 2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A scatter gun deals its highest damage at point-blank range, less at short range, and no damage at medium or long range. It uses individual shells rather than a power pack and holds 10 shells.</p>","economics":{"cost":275,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-scattergun","recordSha256":"76151174f87be2f6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sg-4-blaster-rifle","name":"SG-4 Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The SG-4 is a combination weapon that fires ordinary blaster bolts out of water and miniature harpoons underwater. Using blaster mode underwater or firing a harpoon out of water halves the weapon's range. Blaster mode uses a standard 50-shot power pack; harpoon mode must be reloaded between shots as a swift action.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sg-4-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"f6b2b7b3c16d1158"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-shock-stick","name":"Shock Stick","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":450,"costNumeric":450,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A shock stick always deals stun damage. If its pre-halving stun damage equals or exceeds a susceptible target's current hit points, the target moves -5 steps on the condition track and is knocked unconscious; otherwise resolve the stun attack normally. It requires an energy cell. It can also be mounted as a rifle bayonet; a wielder proficient with that rifle takes no nonproficiency penalty for the mounted shock stick.</p>","economics":{"cost":450,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Shock Stick","recordSha256":"dfea3858913f272f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-shock-whip","name":"Shock Whip","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A shock whip has reach 2 squares. On a hit, after dealing normal weapon damage, the wielder may make a grab attack as a free action against that target if it is no more than one size category larger. This uses a second attack roll at the wielder's normal attack bonus and does not take the normal -5 grab penalty; if it hits, the target is grabbed. Once per turn as a swift action, the wielder can automatically deal 2d6 energy damage to a target grabbed by the whip without another attack roll. If the wielder has the Trip feat, the whip can knock the target prone instead of making the grab attack. While the whip is grabbing a target, it cannot attack other targets. It requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":2.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Reach"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Reach"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Shock Whip","recordSha256":"33d484540fdfe357"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-shockboxing-gloves","name":"Shockboxing Gloves","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"0","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":0,"costNumeric":0,"damage":"0","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Shockboxing gloves add +1 damage to a successful unarmed attack. As a swift action they can be set to stun, converting the wearer's unarmed damage to stun damage while retaining the +1 bonus. They are two sizes smaller than the wearer and cannot be disarmed or dropped.</p>","economics":{"cost":0,"weight":0},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Shockboxing Gloves","recordSha256":"8dbaa25c4afac814"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-shockstaff","name":"Shockstaff","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":3500,"costNumeric":3500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A shockstaff is laced with phrik alloy, so lightsabers do not ignore its damage reduction. It can deal stun damage equal to its normal damage and can be set to stun as a swift action. It is a double weapon: both ends can be used in a full-round attack with the normal -10 penalties before reductions from feats or talents. It requires two energy cells.</p>","economics":{"cost":3500,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Shockstaff","recordSha256":"fe5679effed082bf"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-short-sword","name":"Short Sword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":40,"costNumeric":40,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The short sword is an ancient simple melee weapon commonly used by warriors who fight with two weapons. The published entry describes it as useful for deflecting melee attacks but grants no standalone numerical defense bonus.</p>","economics":{"cost":40,"weight":1.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Short Sword","recordSha256":"325eab20190a50dd"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-shyarn","name":"Shyarn","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":40,"costNumeric":40,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A character wielding a shyarn takes no penalty to attack rolls when using the Rapid Strike feat.</p>","economics":{"cost":40,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Shyarn","recordSha256":"d3172c2c66bb669e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-siang-lance","name":"Siang Lance","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A siang lance is an ancient sporting blaster rifle with an affixed bayonet, normally wielded one-handed. It can make attacks of opportunity: when an attack of opportunity is triggered, the wielder can choose either a ranged shot with the lance or a melee attack with its bayonet. It uses a power pack with 100 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-siang-lance","recordSha256":"c6955256a006ae76"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sidearm-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Sidearm","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":250,"max":250,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A sidearm blaster pistol uses energy-trickle technology for 250 shots per power pack. If it is used with Rapid Shot or a feat that has Rapid Shot as a prerequisite, the wielder must spend a swift action to reset its trigger before it can fire again.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Military"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sidearm-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"b3d5175974fb2cfe"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sith-lanvarok","name":"Sith Lanvarok","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"disc"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":4000,"costNumeric":4000,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A Sith lanvarok is a wrist-mounted disc launcher that is worn rather than held, leaving the wielder's hands free. It uses pistol ranges and can be fired as a second weapon for two-weapon fighting. It is inaccurate and cannot attack at long range. It holds 5 discs; replacement discs cost 5 credits and weigh 0.1 kg each.</p>","economics":{"cost":4000,"weight":5.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Exotic","Sith","Multi-Target"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Exotic","Sith","Multi-Target"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":5.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sith-lanvarok","recordSha256":"6b72187a8e0cdf6c"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sith-sword","name":"Sith Sword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":3000,"costNumeric":3000,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A Sith sword is an alchemically treated archaic blade. Lightsabers do not ignore its damage reduction. A proficient wielder can treat it as a lightsaber for Block, Deflect, Redirect Shot, and talents that use those abilities as prerequisites. As a swift action, a proficient wielder can spend a Force Point to add a damage bonus equal to the wielder's Dark Side Score to the next attack made before the end of the encounter; using this ability also increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.</p>","economics":{"cost":3000,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Sith Alchemy","Lightsaber Resistant","Critical 19-20"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Sith Alchemy","Lightsaber Resistant","Critical 19-20"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sith-sword","recordSha256":"bc38f46722ff75a3"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sling","name":"Sling","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":35,"costNumeric":35,"damage":"1d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A sling hurls metal bullets or stones. The wielder's Strength modifier applies to damage dealt with a sling.</p>","economics":{"cost":35,"weight":0.3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sling","recordSha256":"56e056512d143637"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-slugthrower-pistol","name":"Slugthrower Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"slug-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A slugthrower pistol fires metal bullets rather than energy bolts. It uses clips instead of power packs; each clip holds 10 slugs, costs 20 credits, and weighs 0.1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Projectile","Ammunition Required"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Projectile","Ammunition Required"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-slugthrower-pistol","recordSha256":"00949b066a1f625d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-slugthrower-rifle","name":"Slugthrower Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":20,"max":20,"type":"slug-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A slugthrower rifle is the larger cousin of the slugthrower pistol. It uses clips instead of power packs; each clip holds 20 slugs, costs 40 credits, and weighs 0.2 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Projectile","Ammunition Required"],"range":"50 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Projectile","Ammunition Required"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-slugthrower-rifle","recordSha256":"fa231e7566f0aa15"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-smoke-grenade","name":"Grenade, Smoke","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A smoke grenade fills a 2-square burst with thick smoke that provides concealment and creates a smoke hazard. The cloud lasts 10 rounds.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-smoke-grenade","recordSha256":"a12c7c7f74a0e479"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-snap-baton","name":"Snap Baton","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A snap baton collapses into a small handle and expands into a 1-meter rod. Expanding or collapsing it is a swift action. Specialized commercial versions can incorporate extra functions such as a panic alarm, glowrod, or sound-dampening layer, typically at increased cost.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Unrestricted"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Unrestricted"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-snap-baton","recordSha256":"e45923389c823839"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-snap-shot-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Snap Shot","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A snap shot blaster pistol carries a single shot in its power pack. Its compact design grants a +5 equipment bonus on Stealth checks made to conceal the weapon. After one shot, the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-snap-shot-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"35685b7157e39a80"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-snare-pistol","name":"Snare Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":2,"max":2,"type":"specialized-snare-cartridge"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d4","type":"stun"}},"cost":600,"costNumeric":600,"damage":"1d4","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A snare pistol fires weighted synthcord and can initiate a grab or grapple at up to Short range. A trapped target can escape with a DC 15 Acrobatics check or break free with a DC 20 Strength check. Pin and Trip can be used with it, but not Crush, Throw, or Bone Crusher. Its specialized cartridge holds 2 shots; replacement cartridges cost 25 credits and weigh 1 kg.</p>","economics":{"cost":600,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-snare-pistol","recordSha256":"521d85dbc5871431"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-snare-rifle","name":"Snare Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"specialized-snare-cartridge"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":1200,"costNumeric":1200,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A snare rifle fires weighted cord at targets within short range and can initiate a grab or grapple at range. If the grab succeeds, the target also takes the rifle's listed stun damage. A grabbed or grappled target can escape with a DC 15 Acrobatics check or break free with a DC 20 Strength check. Pin and Trip can be used with the snare rifle, but Crush and Throw cannot. Its cartridge holds 5 shots; replacement cartridges weigh 2 kg and cost 50 credits.</p>","economics":{"cost":1200,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-snare-rifle","recordSha256":"572205dac9ba35be"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sniper-blaster-rifle","name":"Blaster Rifle, Sniper","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A sniper blaster rifle is an accurate weapon designed for prepared long-range fire. If the wielder does not aim at the target immediately before attacking, the attack takes a -5 penalty. A bipod and targeting scope are mounted on the rifle and included in its listed cost. The weapon cannot benefit from the rapid recycler upgrade. Its power pack provides 10 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Accurate"],"range":"80 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sniper-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"51789662dda62bba"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sonic-disruptor","name":"Sonic Disruptor","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":10,"max":10,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"sonic"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"sonic","description":"<p>Sonic disruptor attacks cannot be negated with Deflect or talents that have Deflect as a prerequisite. The weapon treats every target's damage threshold as 5 lower. A creature killed, or an object, vehicle, or droid destroyed, by the weapon is disintegrated. It can fire only once every other round, and it cannot be used with feats, talents, or abilities that consume more than one shot per round. Its power pack must be recharged after 10 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sonic-disruptor","recordSha256":"e0e2fd4ed302486a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sonic-pistol","name":"Sonic Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"sonic"}},"cost":900,"costNumeric":900,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"sonic","description":"<p>A sonic pistol deals sonic energy damage. Its ranged attacks cannot be negated with Deflect or talents that have Deflect as a prerequisite. Its power pack must be recharged after 100 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":900,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Sonic"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Sonic"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sonic-pistol","recordSha256":"ffee99565eeb08e6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sonic-rifle","name":"Sonic Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"sonic"}},"cost":900,"costNumeric":900,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"sonic","description":"<p>A sonic rifle deals sonic energy damage. Its ranged attacks cannot be negated with Deflect or talents that have Deflect as a prerequisite. Its power pack must be recharged after 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":900,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Sonic"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Sonic"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sonic-rifle","recordSha256":"cc1fd9a68c7c64b4"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sonic-stunner","name":"Sonic Stunner","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":450,"costNumeric":450,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A sonic stunner deals stun damage by directing high-frequency sonic energy into a living target. Deaf creatures are still affected because the vibrations penetrate the brain. Only the target hears the weapon's sound, so firing it is otherwise silent.</p>","economics":{"cost":450,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sonic-stunner","recordSha256":"3d98784e9b237ea9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-spear","name":"Spear","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":60,"costNumeric":60,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A spear is a long pole with a sharp end fashioned from stone or metal. Spears can be used as thrown weapons.</p>","economics":{"cost":60,"weight":1.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Thrown"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Thrown"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Spear","recordSha256":"37b60e1b89605857"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sporting-blaster-carbine","name":"Blaster Carbine, Sporting","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":100,"max":100,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A sporting blaster carbine is normally inaccurate, but it is not treated as an inaccurate weapon when wielded in two hands. Like other blaster carbines, it can make attacks of opportunity even without a folded stock. A power pack provides 100 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":2.6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":2.6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sporting-blaster-carbine","recordSha256":"201d6c6b5b3fa7b7"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sporting-blaster-pistol","name":"Blaster Pistol, Sporting","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":6,"max":6,"type":"energy-cell"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A sporting blaster pistol is a compact civilian blaster used for small-game hunting or personal defense. It requires an energy cell; after 6 shots the cell must be replaced. It can also be attached to a power pack; after 100 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Civilian"],"range":"20 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Civilian"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sporting-blaster-pistol","recordSha256":"5733a7a508286961"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-sporting-blaster-rifle","name":"Blaster Rifle, Sporting","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Sporting blaster rifles are common hunting and recreational weapons. They often have a targeting scope mounted, but the scope is not included in the listed weapon cost. A sporting blaster rifle requires a power pack; after 50 shots the power pack must be replaced.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Licensed","Accurate"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Licensed","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-sporting-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"35cb41c92b23441e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-squib-tensor-rifle","name":"Squib Tensor Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":15,"max":15,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":10000,"costNumeric":10000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Attacks with a Squib tensor rifle are made against the target's Fortitude Defense. On a successful attack, the target moves -1 step on the condition track regardless of the damage roll. Squibs treat the weapon as a rifle rather than an exotic weapon. It is treated as a rifle for determining range and uses a 15-shot power pack.</p>","economics":{"cost":10000,"weight":7.2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Restricted","Rare"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Restricted","Rare"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":7.2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-squib-tensor-rifle","recordSha256":"8c4e373ad9386b3b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-static-pike","name":"Static Pike","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A static pike is a reach weapon. It can be set to lethal or stun damage, can be thrown like a spear, and requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Thrown","Reach"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Thrown","Reach"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Static Pike","recordSha256":"648ebb21bd5f268e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stokhli-spray-stick","name":"Stokhli Spray Stick","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":80,"max":80,"type":"spraymist-canister"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"stun"}},"cost":14000,"costNumeric":14000,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A Stokhli spray stick deals stun damage and coats the target in sticky webbing. Its webbing functions as a net, allowing the attacker to initiate a grab or grapple at range. It uses spraymist canisters; each canister provides 80 shots and costs 100 credits.</p>","economics":{"cost":14000,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Inaccurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-stokhli-spray-stick","recordSha256":"0c5ed2981ce72427"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stun-baton","name":"Stun Baton","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":15,"costNumeric":15,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A stun baton is a short club with a power pack in the handle. It can be activated to produce a stunning charge when it strikes a target, using the normal Stunning rules. A stun baton requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":15,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Stun","Non-Lethal"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Stun","Non-Lethal"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-stun-baton","recordSha256":"caed1bbedf3c90d2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stun-grenade","name":"Grenade, Stun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A stun grenade explodes on contact and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make one attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Targets hit take full stun damage and targets missed take half stun damage; the stun damage can move targets down the condition track. Evasion modifies the area attack as normal. Droids, vehicles, and objects are immune to stun damage.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Stun","Non-Lethal","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Stun","Non-Lethal","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-stun-grenade","recordSha256":"bfe986b7e91f3f54"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stun-pistol","name":"Stun Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":550,"costNumeric":550,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A stun pistol can attack targets up to 20 squares away instead of the normal 6-square range for stun attacks. It requires a power pack, which must be replaced after 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":550,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-stun-pistol","recordSha256":"be4414432df3d77b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stunning-gauntlet","name":"Stunning Gauntlet","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"0","type":"energy"}},"cost":0,"costNumeric":0,"damage":"0","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A stunning gauntlet is an insulated glove with an embedded energy cell. While worn, the wearer's unarmed melee attacks deal stun damage and gain a +1 bonus to stun damage. Stunning gauntlets are two size categories smaller than their wearer and, because they are worn, cannot be disarmed or dropped.</p>","economics":{"cost":0,"weight":0},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Stunning Gauntlet","recordSha256":"e52ecb4073448bd5"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-subrepeating-blaster","name":"Subrepeating Blaster","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":750,"costNumeric":750,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A subrepeating blaster is an autofire-only pistol with a retractable stock. Unless the stock is extended, it cannot be braced before making an autofire attack. It uses a power pack and must have the pack replaced after 50 shots.</p>","economics":{"cost":750,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"15 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-subrepeating-blaster","recordSha256":"db2d05a05a535532"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-survival-knife","name":"Survival Knife","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A survival knife has a hollow handle that can store very small items such as compact survival tools. Its built-in digital compass lets a character carrying it always determine which way is north. It can be thrown, but it is an inaccurate weapon and cannot attack targets at long range.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Survival Knife","recordSha256":"626a23ad464d18fe"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-tactical-tractor-beam","name":"Tactical Tractor Beam","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":8000,"costNumeric":8000,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A tactical tractor beam requires a power generator and affects only Huge or smaller targets. A grabbed object can be moved up to 10 squares in any direction and can be hurled at another target within 10 squares using a ranged attack, dealing falling-object damage by size. It normally requires a second crew member to spend a standard action each round regulating power; if not regulated, attacks take -2. On a tripod it is treated as one size smaller for wielding.</p>","economics":{"cost":8000,"weight":25},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"heavy-weapons","properties":["Military"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-tactical-tractor-beam","recordSha256":"3420060bf41ff86e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-targeting-blaster-rifle","name":"Targeting Blaster Rifle","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A targeting blaster rifle can be assembled or disassembled as a full-round action. If the wielder aims before making an attack, the weapon's damage dice change from d6s to d8s. It does not have a folding stock and uses a 50-shot power pack. The weapon is accurate and takes no attack penalty at short range.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Restricted","Accurate"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Restricted","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-targeting-blaster-rifle","recordSha256":"ab30f610ea3d0568"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-targeting-laser","name":"Targeting Laser","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A targeting laser deals no damage. Its wielder makes an attack roll that ignores armor bonuses to the target's Reflex Defense. As long as the wielder repeats the attack each round, allies who know the laser frequency gain +2 on attacks against that target with missile launchers, grenade launchers, or vehicle weapons. It requires an energy cell and can be handheld or mounted on a Medium or larger weapon.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":0.1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Licensed"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Licensed"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-targeting-laser","recordSha256":"b6a770f631a84a1b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-tehkla-blade","name":"Tehkla Blade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":8500,"costNumeric":8500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>If an attack roll with a tehk'la blade equals or exceeds both the target's Reflex Defense and Fortitude Defense, the target takes an additional 1d6 points of bleeding damage at the start of its next turn. A tehk'la blade requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":8500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Tehkla Blade","recordSha256":"7245d71c916941dc"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-thermal-detonator","name":"Thermal Detonator","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"8d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"8d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A thermal detonator has a timer adjustable from 1 to 3 rounds. When it detonates, make one area attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in its 4-square burst radius. Targets hit take full damage and targets missed take half damage; Evasion modifies this as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use","Restricted"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use","Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-thermal-detonator","recordSha256":"9a23bc684abe4f7d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-thud-bug","name":"Thud Bug","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A thud bug is thrown by hand but is treated as a simple weapon, not a thrown weapon, for purposes of determining range. The wielder can choose to deal stun damage instead of normal damage against a target at point-blank or short range.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"range":"12 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-thud-bug","recordSha256":"5a0dac3b3e515254"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-tusken-gaderffii-stick","name":"Gaderffii","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":60,"costNumeric":60,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A gaderffii, or gaffi stick, is a Tusken pole weapon with a blade or spike at one end and a bludgeoning head at the other. It is a double weapon; both ends can be used in a full-round attack, with the normal -10 penalty to each attack before reductions from feats or talents.</p>","economics":{"cost":60,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Double Weapon","Two-Handed","Primitive"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Double Weapon","Two-Handed","Primitive"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-tusken-gaderffii-stick","recordSha256":"de5921f594d47138"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-variable-blaster","name":"Blaster Rifle, Variable","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":500,"max":500,"type":"power-pack"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"autofire":true,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":1300,"costNumeric":1300,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A variable blaster rifle has a 500-shot power pack. As a swift action its power can be changed: the stronger 3d6 setting consumes five times as many shots per attack, and the 3d8 setting consumes ten times as many; the weakest setting uses ammunition normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":1300,"weight":5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"rifles","properties":["Military","Autofire"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Military","Autofire"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-variable-blaster","recordSha256":"0caeb71e1baba961"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-verpine-shattergun","name":"Verpine Shatter Gun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":50,"max":50,"type":"special-ammunition-clip"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d10","type":"energy"}},"cost":15000,"costNumeric":15000,"damage":"3d10","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>On a successful critical hit, a Verpine shatter gun deals an additional 1d10 damage after the normal critical-hit multiplication. If the weapon takes any damage, it is disabled until repaired with a Mechanics check. Verpines treat the weapon as a pistol rather than an exotic weapon, and it is treated as a pistol for determining range. It uses a special 50-shot ammunition clip costing 1,000 credits. The weapon is accurate and takes no attack penalty at short range.</p>","economics":{"cost":15000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"range":"25 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Illegal","Rare","Accurate"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-verpine-shattergun","recordSha256":"94d23bc88f26dc2b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibro-ax","name":"Vibro-Ax","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A vibro-ax has an energy cell that causes its blade to vibrate rapidly when activated, giving it much greater cutting power than a standard axe. A vibro-ax requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":6},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibro-Ax","recordSha256":"36ea110e5f3c5d0a"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibro-saw","name":"Vibro-Saw","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A vibro-saw ignores a target's Damage Reduction. It requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":10},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Ignores DR"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Ignores DR"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibro-Saw","recordSha256":"d4d2ef141b8bb21e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibrobayonet","name":"Vibrobayonet","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":350,"costNumeric":350,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>When mounted on a rifle, a vibrobayonet allows the rifle to be used as a potent melee weapon. Even if you used the rifle for a ranged attack on your last turn, you still threaten squares within your reach and can make attacks of opportunity. It requires two hands when mounted and cannot be used on a rifle with a folded stock. Detached from a rifle it functions as a vibrodagger; mounted it deals more damage because of the added leverage and bulk. It requires an energy cell that is separate from the rifle's power pack.</p>","economics":{"cost":350,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibrobayonet","recordSha256":"b23ca28032fe4f66"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibroblade","name":"Vibroblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The vibroblade is a close-combat weapon favored by soldiers and mercenaries. Vibroblades are illegal in most urban areas. A vibroblade requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":1.8},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1.8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-vibroblade","recordSha256":"536b225d0972dbf3"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibroblade-double","name":"Vibroblade, Double","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":550,"costNumeric":550,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A double vibroblade is a double weapon. Both ends can be used in a full-round attack, with the normal -10 penalties before reductions from feats or talents. It requires two energy cells.</p>","economics":{"cost":550,"weight":4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibroblade, Double","recordSha256":"786debd5fb771a59"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibrodagger","name":"Vibrodagger","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d4","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"2d4","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>The vibrodagger is the smallest vibro weapon. It is subject to very little regulation because it is viewed as a common tool for crafters and explorers. A vibrodagger requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20","Concealable"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20","Concealable"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-vibrodagger","recordSha256":"2de0b64a7046de0f"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibroknucklers","name":"Vibroknucklers","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"0","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"0","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Vibroknucklers add +3 damage to a successful unarmed attack. They are two size categories smaller than the wearer and cannot be disarmed or dropped. While worn, the wearer's unarmed attacks count both as normal unarmed attacks treated as simple weapons and as attacks with an advanced melee weapon. Vibroknucklers require an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibroknucklers","recordSha256":"f34b44029de3d6fc"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibrolance","name":"Vibrolance","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A vibrolance is a large reach weapon whose vibroblade can deal piercing or slashing damage. It is too large and unwieldy to be thrown effectively and requires an energy cell.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Reach"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Reach"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibrolance","recordSha256":"e237c79b20320846"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibrorapier","name":"Vibrorapier","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A vibrorapier uses a long, thin, well-balanced blade and a specialized design that suppresses the ultrasonic noise typical of vibro weapons, making it completely silent in use. It requires two energy cells to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":1.4},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":1.4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Vibrorapier","recordSha256":"293d830d8dafd0db"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-vibrosword","name":"Vibrosword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":450,"costNumeric":450,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A vibrosword is an oversized vibroblade intended for two-handed use. It requires an energy cell to operate.</p>","economics":{"cost":450,"weight":3},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"advanced-melee","properties":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"advanced-melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"advanced","traits":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"advanced-melee","weight":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-vibrosword","recordSha256":"4e79df916ca07ac4"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-wan-shen","name":"Wan-Shen","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":1000,"costNumeric":1000,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A wan-shen can be broken down into four Small objects; assembling or disassembling it is a full-round action. It increases reach by 1 square and is a double weapon, allowing attacks with both ends using the normal double-weapon full-round rules.</p>","economics":{"cost":1000,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Reach","Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":["Reach","Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Wan-Shen","recordSha256":"6aa74c815fe75f0d"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-war-sword","name":"War Sword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"1d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":50,"costNumeric":50,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A war sword is a heavy, durable longsword made from high-quality materials. The published weapon entry grants no additional special combat rule beyond the weapon-table statistics.</p>","economics":{"cost":50,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":[],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"simple","traits":[],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::War Sword","recordSha256":"dd0c9559cfef4114"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-wookiee-ryyk-blade","name":"Ryyk Blade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d10","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"2d10","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>Wookiees who have Weapon Proficiency (advanced melee weapons) are proficient with the ryyk blade. A proficient character carrying one gains a +2 bonus on Survival checks made for basic survival in forest or jungle wilderness.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":1.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Wookiee","Critical 19-20"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Wookiee","Critical 19-20"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-wookiee-ryyk-blade","recordSha256":"d1ed8c7c137fd0a0"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-wrist-blaster","name":"Blaster, Wrist","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"power-cell"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d4","type":"energy"}},"cost":800,"costNumeric":800,"damage":"3d4","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A wrist blaster is built into jewelry or a bracer and carries enough power for only one shot. It is intended for close quarters and is masked from weapon sensor scans; detecting it with a sensor scan requires a DC 25 Use Computer check.</p>","economics":{"cost":800,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"pistols","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"8 squares","rangeProfile":"pistols","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"pistol","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"pistols","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-wrist-blaster","recordSha256":"6b9db733c12c7304"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-wrist-rocket-launcher","name":"Wrist Rocket Launcher","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"wrist-rockets"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":2500,"costNumeric":2500,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A wrist rocket launcher mounts on the forearm and is a single-shot weapon that must be reloaded after every shot. Its effect depends on the rocket loaded; the published ammunition includes antipersonnel, antivehicle, flash, hollow-tip payload, stun-gas, and ion-blast rockets.</p>","economics":{"cost":2500,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Wrist-Mounted","Launcher","Ammunition Required"],"range":"10 squares","rangeProfile":"heavy-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"heavy","traits":["Wrist-Mounted","Launcher","Ammunition Required"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"heavy-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-wrist-rocket-launcher","recordSha256":"446f81e1d41d9192"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-xerrol-nightstinger","name":"Xerrol Nightstinger","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":5,"max":5,"type":"exotic-gas-canister"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":1500,"costNumeric":1500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>The Xerrol Nightstinger uses exotic-gas canisters to fire shots invisible to the eye, allowing a sniper to shoot without visually revealing the firing position. Each gas canister provides 5 shots and costs 1,000 credits.</p>","economics":{"cost":1500,"weight":4.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"30 squares","rangeProfile":"rifles","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"rifle","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"rifles","weight":4.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-xerrol-nightstinger","recordSha256":"b0249537cc7d24e2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-zhaboka","name":"Zhaboka","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":0,"max":0,"type":"none"},"attackAttribute":"str","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"str","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"str","bonus":0,"dice":"2d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":165,"costNumeric":165,"damage":"2d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A character wielding a zhaboka takes no penalty to attack rolls when using Rapid Strike. A zhaboka is also a double weapon; both ends can be used in a full-round attack with the normal -10 penalties before reductions from feats or talents.</p>","economics":{"cost":165,"weight":2},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"exotic","properties":["Double Weapon"],"range":"Melee","rangeProfile":"melee","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"exotic","traits":["Double Weapon"],"weaponCategory":"melee","weaponType":"melee","weight":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"unmapped::Zhaboka","recordSha256":"01d8611fc02fdde8"}}}}
